      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Arcadie bowling bag from the Miu Miu Fall/Winter 2025 runway features a compact, plush silhouette in cognac calfskin with a distressed finish, evoking a nostalgic charm. Embellished with logo appliqués and a gold padlock, it adds refined details to the bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
