    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Arcadie bag debuted in Miu Miu's Spring/Summer 2023 collection, its name inspired by the ancient Greek mythological 'utopia' (Arcadia). With a clean, rounded rectangular shape, double zippers, and arched top handles, it resembles a soft, pillowy loaf of bread. Since its launch, Arcadie has won over style-savvy women, now available in a wide range of colors, materials, and sizes.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
