    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Details & Embellishments ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Though compact and simple at first glance, this Arcadie is full of thoughtful details—rounded piping adds softness, paired with dark brown stitching.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer has cut 'MIU MIU' logo letters from matching leather and appliquéd them to the bag's center with light brown stitching, creating a three-dimensional, handcrafted feel reminiscent of a mother's needlework—rustic and comforting.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The double handles are secured with a leather strap and snap button, keeping them upright and neat; the base features four gold half-sphere feet engraved with the brand logo, protecting the bottom from wear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
