    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag comes with a detachable and adjustable shoulder strap made of slim matching calfskin, with a minimum drop of 53cm and a maximum drop of 57cm, allowing for hand-carry, arm-carry, shoulder, and crossbody wear.",
