      "text": "This generously padded compact bag offers ample space. We packed in essentials like a phone, keys, makeup touch-ups, and even a small notebook. You can also toss in odds and ends like earphones or a compact powder. With the double-protection zipper and padlock, it scores high on both style and practicality.",
