      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MIU MIU Cognac Arcadie top-handle bag. Designers: Miuccia Prada & Raf Simons. Dimensions: 19cm wide, 13cm high, 6cm base. Weight: 420g. Retail price ¥26,700.",
