    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu is an Italian luxury fashion brand from Milan, founded in 1993 by fashion designer Miuccia Prada. It offers women's ready-to-wear, handbags, footwear, eyewear, fragrances, and accessories, targeting a young female clientele. The design team is based in Milan, with the corporate headquarters relocated to Paris in 2015. Since 1993 from Paris.",
